cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Cello in a project, cite this software release."
title: "Cello: Biochemical Cell Simulator"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Bitar
    given-names: Abdsalam
version: 1.7.0
date-released: 2026-09-19
license: LicenseRef-Proprietary
abstract: >-
  Cello is an interactive biochemical cell simulator and research-oriented
  visualization platform for Windows x64. Version 1.7.0 adds a reproducible
  Microenvironment Engine for extracellular boundary conditions and scheduled
  environment changes while retaining simulation recording, experiment
  workspaces, pathway exploration, perturbation workflows, quantitative
  analysis, and virtual-cell population simulation.
keywords:
  - biochemistry
  - cell simulation
  - systems biology
  - scientific visualization
  - computational biology
  - microenvironment
  - population simulation
